  "description": "LLM-backed IContentExtractor for WebReaper, bound to Microsoft.Extensions.AI.Abstractions (IChatClient). Bring your own model — OpenAI, Anthropic, Ollama, anything implementing IChatClient. Adds ScraperEngineBuilder.WithLlmExtractor. Satellite package (ADR-0009) so the WebReaper core stays dependency-light and AOT-clean.",
